+# Vercel AI SDK static boundary
+
+The support invocation in `/src/support-agent.ts` passes a request built outside the `generateText` call. Its `prepareStep` callback can replace `instructions`, so static inspection cannot establish that the call uses a supported direct generation pattern or determine which instructions are effective at generation time.
+
+Treat this as an unresolved integration boundary. To make the pattern directly inspectable, pass the generation options to `generateText` at the call site, supply the intended instructions there, prevent `prepareStep` from replacing them, and cover that invocation with a focused test.
